{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/reviews/id1790947666"}, "name":{"label":"Loopylooloo456"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2025-05-26T09:06:01-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.2.6"}, "id":{"label":"12700795884"}, "title":{"label":"Not 100% accurate"}, "content":{"label":"I only downloaded this so I could have it displayed on my Apple Watch face and at a glance see my steps for the day which is something Apple Watch don’t offer themselves, but it’s highly inaccurate. Apple counts your steps on the watch (it just doesn’t display them so you have to tap to check every time) but they never match. Pedometer app is usually out by sometimes as much as 400 steps but usually 200/300, so I end up having to go into the fitness app on my watch to view my actual steps anyway 🤦🏻‍♀️ never used to be an issue and they would always be in sync but since the last update just always out.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/gb/review?id=712286167&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
